ing bad or anything they might not  even feel pity or compassion a Laos in  Greek towards you but they could at  least say wow man you're screwing up  here's how you could do better so the  long and short answer of this is there's  a lot of candidates for being sages we  know quite a bit about what the stoics  think of sage hypothetically would  feel like think like behave like talk  like but we don't have a lot of people  who we can point to and say that's  definitively a stoic Sage we have at  best candidates that are looked to by  many people within classic and modern  stoicism as having been Sages
 

